      (∀i,∀P∈lists i,Prime P) → (∀i,∀P∈lists i,ringChar (Eis⧸P)≠2) →
      (∀i,1≤H i) → (∀i,∀P∈lists i,(Ideal.absNorm P:ℝ)≤H i) → (∏i,H i)≤Z^z₀ →
    ∀(Ψ:Eis→*ℂ),(∀n,‖Ψ n‖≤1) →
